### Trigger full invoice sync (raw + stage)
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/sync/invoice

### Trigger invoice raw sync only
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/raw/invoice

### Recover one invoice raw date window without moving the sync cursor
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/raw/invoice/window
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-05-15",
  "to": "2026-05-16",
  "note": "Recover failed raw invoice window"
}

### Trigger invoice stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/stage/invoice

### Trigger invoiceEvent stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/stage/invoiceEvent

### Trigger full invoiceEvent sync (expected to be source-owned by invoice and skip)
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/sync/invoiceEvent

### Trigger full invoice sync (raw + stage) on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/sync/invoice

### Trigger invoice raw sync only on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/raw/invoice

### Recover one invoice raw date window on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/raw/invoice/window
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-05-15",
  "to": "2026-05-16",
  "note": "Recover failed raw invoice window"
}

### Trigger invoice stage sync only on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/invoice

### Trigger invoiceEvent stage sync only on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/invoiceEvent

### Trigger full invoiceEvent sync on Docker collector (expected to skip)
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/sync/invoiceEvent

### List configured ingestion entities
GET http://localhost:3000/ingestion/entities

### List configured ingestion entities on Docker collector
GET http://localhost:3010/ingestion/entities
